  "source": "Cycle of Prayer 2026",
  "sourceFile": "\"Cycle of Prayer - EDGL.docx\", provided directly by Josh via Google Drive (file id 1bw5etzmfBYYFjrUiKpZH3s0XmnemPhIs, folder \"TEC Cycle of Prayer\"); original diocesan source per Josh's own roster (a live Google Doc): https://docs.google.com/document/d/19pLzxtD7K1vfVkGFU6zgkNOF7BdAxAsSoFEQTEaP6Jw/edit",
